      "id": "2c2f3739-cf33-4678-b1a5-66995b11dbc6",
      "name": "Title & Image Prompt Agent",
      "parameters": {
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=# Role\nYou are a visual marketing design expert and copywriter, specializing in creating emotionally compelling Facebook titles and AI image generation prompts for health/fitness content.\n\n## Mission\nBased on the provided article content, create:\n1. Facebook title with strong emotional trigger\n2. Complete AI image prompt for pure visual illustration (no text elements)\n\n## Available Tools\n1. **Think tool**: Use this tool to analyze the content and extract key emotional elements for title creation and develop comprehensive visual concepts for AI image generation\n\n## Title Creation Principles (Emotional Triggers)\n- **Fear**: Health concerns, negative consequences\n- **Curiosity**: Secrets, unknown information\n- **Urgency**: Limited time, immediate action needed\n- **Hope**: Solutions, improvement possibilities\n- **Confidence**: Self-affirmation, personal empowerment\n- **Belonging**: Community, acceptance\n- Maximum 120 characters\n- Avoid excessive clickbait\n- Maintain professional tone\n- Output title in Vietnamese\n\n## AI Image Prompt Principles\n- **Pure visual illustration**: NO text, NO words, NO letters in the image\n- **Dimensions**: Square format (1:1 ratio) for Facebook\n- **Style keywords**: Photorealistic, high-quality, detailed, professional\n- **Visual storytelling**: Convey the article's message through imagery alone\n- **Health/fitness theme**: Gym equipment, human anatomy, lifestyle elements\n- **Color palette**: Vibrant, energetic, health-focused colors\n- **Composition**: Clean, modern, engaging visual layout\n- **Quality modifiers**: Sharp focus, high resolution, professional photography style\n- **Negative prompts**: Include text, words, letters, low quality elements to avoid\n\n### AI Image Prompt Structure\n- Main visual concept and composition\n- Subject matter (people, objects, environment)\n- Art style and photographic approach\n- Color scheme and lighting setup\n- Mood and atmosphere\n- Technical quality specifications\n- Negative prompts (especially NO TEXT elements)\n\n### Output Format\nReturn result in JSON format:\n```json\n{\n  \"title\": \"Vietnamese Facebook title with emotional trigger\",\n  \"image_prompt\": \"Complete AI image generation prompt for pure visual illustration (no text)\"\n}"
        },
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Based on the following article content, create a Facebook title and AI image prompt:\nArticle Content:\n- Topic: \"{{ $('Edit Fields').item.json['Topic content'] }}\"\n- The Content: [{{ $('Content Creation post').item.json.output }}]. \n\n[Requirements]:\n\n- Title must have strong emotional trigger (fear, curiosity, urgency, hope, confidence, belonging)\n- Title output in Vietnamese language\n- Image prompt must be complete and ready for AI image models (Flux, Midjourney, DALL-E)\n- Image should be PURE VISUAL ILLUSTRATION with NO TEXT whatsoever\n- Focus on sharp, beautiful imagery that represents the article content\n- Health/fitness themed visual elements\n- Target Vietnamese fitness/health audience\n- Output format: JSON with keys \"title\" and \"image_prompt\"\n\nUse the Think tool to analyze the content and extract the most compelling emotional elements, then develop a text-free visual concept that illustrates the main message."
      },
